WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.786 --> 00:00:07.301
The next day at practice Javier didn't know where to start. Malcolm had always run the crew's practices.

2
00:00:07.302 --> 00:00:16.439
"I guess we should talk about music first. We have to decide on that before we do any

3
00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:19.866
