The enthusiasm on Will's face faded abruptly as he looked up. "Oh, no. What are they doing here?"

5
00:00:27.278 --> 00:00:35.596
Javier turned to see Malcolm and Marty peering through the narrow windows on each side of the

6
00:00:35.597 --> 00:00:41.929
gym doors. "I'll go find out." But by the time he reached the doors, the ex-members of the

7
