got a good laugh from Marty. Harry and Christopher walked slowly down the corridor, as if to show

10
00:00:59.161 --> 00:01:07.478
Malcolm that they didn't need to hurry. "What did Malcolm and Marty want?" Javier was worried that Malcolm

11
00:01:07.479 --> 00:01:13.993
was trying to lure away their new dancers. "Not much." Christopher shrugged. "They were just trying to find

12
00:01:13.994 --> 00:01:21.056
out who joined the crew and what music we're using." "It's none of their business!" Will snapped. "We're

