00:03:07.231 --> 00:03:13.283
Give the judges a break. You don't want to be the fortieth crew dancing to Moldy Bread,

23
00:03:13.284 --> 00:03:21.132
or whatever that band's name is." He went back into the office, still shaking his head. "Happy Banter?

24
00:03:21.133 --> 00:03:28.868
The boy band from the nineties?" Pablo said. "Their lead singer must be as old as Mr. D.,"

