we just need music," he told himself. "This is going to turn out fine!" *** In the

32
00:04:07.027 --> 00:04:14.488
past Malcolm had simply chosen the music without any discussion among the crew. Now there were five strong

33
00:04:14.489 --> 00:04:19.257
opinions, and everyone's opinion counted. The crew finally picked an electronic piece without words and a Happy Banter

34
00:04:19.258 --> 00:04:26.235
song. Will edited the pieces together. The final cut was two minutes. Javier started working out the choreography

35
00:04:26.236 --> 00:04:33.474
with some help from Tessa. Then the rest of the crew helped him iron it out. Over the

36
