nervously waiting for halftime—and Pablo. By now Will was pacing the office. "There are only three minutes left

46
00:05:43.005 --> 00:05:50.005
before we have to go out there, and Pablo's not answering his phone! What are we going to

47
00:05:50.006 --> 00:05:55.662
do, Mr. D.? Pablo's supposed to freestyle in the middle of the dance!" "I'm sure you boys will

48
00:05:55.663 --> 00:06:04.744
think of something," Mr. D. said. "Okay, don't panic," Javier said. "How about if we all take

49
00:06:04.745 --> 00:06:11.164
turns freestyling?" "I don't know." Christopher hesitated. "I'm not the best freestyler . . ." Harry stared out

50
00:06:11.165 --> 00:06:15.828
into the bleachers. He didn't have to say anything. It was clear he wasn't confident about his freestyling

51
00:06:15.829 --> 00:06:20.746
