52
00:06:20.747 --> 00:06:33.815
if you run out of moves, well . . . Will can fill in. Right, Will?" "I guess

53
00:06:33.816 --> 00:06:45.382
so. If I have to." Will didn't look happy. The halftime buzzer sounded. As soon as the teams

54
00:06:45.383 --> 00:06:51.706
cleared the court, the crew's music started playing. The guys ran onto the floor and began to dance.

55
00:06:51.707 --> 00:06:55.871
The spectators cheered. "Hey . . ." Javier thought. He suddenly realized that the right number of guys

56
00:06:55.872 --> 00:07:02.275
